{{!
    @template local_coursegen/template_naming_preview_box

    Empty box the naming preview is rendered into (see
    local_coursegen/template_naming_preview and step_limits.js). It sits
    inside the configuration form, between the naming fields and the rest of
    the page.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="local_coursegen/template/naming-preview" on the box, whose
      contents step_limits.js replaces on every change of the pattern.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * none

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
<div class="bg-light rounded p-2" data-region="local_coursegen/template/naming-preview"></div>
